        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Part"><strong>Steps</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Write">Numbered actions from a clean start</td>
          <td data-label="Tip">Anyone can follow</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Part"><strong>Expected and actual</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Write">What should happen and what did</td>
