        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Part"><strong>Evidence</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Write">Screenshot, log line or recording</td>
          <td data-label="Tip">Attach it</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p>
    If a colleague cannot repeat the bug from your steps, rewrite the steps.
  </p>

